[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16510.629, "timestamp": "04:35:10", "text": "你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16512.629, "timestamp": "04:35:12", "text": "看，我猜是因為腫瘤的緣故，Tumorhead 的視力很差。  或許我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16520.709, "timestamp": "04:35:20", "text": "可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16522.789, "timestamp": "04:35:22", "text": "騙過她。藏身處再見。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16525.59, "timestamp": "04:35:25", "text": "好的。嘿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16528.949, "timestamp": "04:35:28", "text": "，別為血光感到難過。這兩個人嗜殺無辜平民。他們是怪物。而且，公開場合親熱很噁心。我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16550.551, "timestamp": "04:35:50", "text": "意思是，真的，成熟點吧。誰都不想看到那種場面。  你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16554.47, "timestamp": "04:35:54", "text": "那麼，我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16556.949, "timestamp": "04:35:56", "text": "走吧。  [音樂] 血光閃耀，寶貝。  我的天，她真是個變態"}]